<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica Feb manufacturing output up 4.9 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>SAfrica Feb manufacturing output up 4.9 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African manufacturing production rose a preliminary 4.9 percent on a seasonally-adjusted basis in February compared with the same month a year ago, the Central Statistical Service (CSS) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, seasonally-adjusted manufacturing production fell 3.6 percent.</p>
<p>Index of the physical volume of manufacturing production</p>
<p>(base 1990=100):</p>
<p>				 Feb '97	 Jan '97	Feb '96</p>
<p>    Seasonally adjusted  106.1	   110.0	  101.1</p>
<p>    Actual		   104.0	    92.3	   99.2</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
